      "id": "business-paragraph",
      "text": "On Tuesday, I helped deploy the cache to two servers. Median latency fell from 80 ms to 60 ms for repeated requests in our 30-minute test. We have not tested cold starts or the other eight servers. The dashboard still shows yesterday's data.",
